      "text": "An author can inspect generated source and declare/edit one supported authored extension through Studio, observe its behavior, and retain it through regeneration.",
      "status": "not_run"
    },
    {
      "requirement": "FR-012",
      "text": "A reviewer can install, build, test and run the generated/exported app with Studio stopped, explicit private configuration, intact data and visitor identity, and no embedded author capability.",
      "status": "not_run"
    },
    {
